WEBVTT

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:31.890
<b>Lemon</b>

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.120
What are you doing, Sanae?

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:38.620
I'm setting up a surveillance 
camera for my house.

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.270
I'd like one of those, too.

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:41.990
Not that we need one.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.130
Well, there have been more burglaries lately.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:47.720
Is that some kind of burger?

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.370
No, we're talking about people

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:52.870
who sneak into houses while nobody's home 
and steal money and possessions.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:54.980
So, it's some kind of robber?

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.140
I guess it would be comforting

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.680
to be able to see what's happening 
at home when you're away.

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:04.660
<b>Watch My Shell While I'm Out?!</b>

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:06.730
Bye!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.450
Where the squid is he going?

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:14.170
He's going to a special 
school session at the sea.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.440
They camp out and have a barbecue.

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:21.160
Pretty luxurious for a little 
grade-schooler to have a night away!

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:24.630
Well, that's what it is, 
so will you watch the house?

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:25.350
Huh?

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.110
Instead of Takeru.

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:29.180
She talked about this yesterday, remember?

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.130
There are a lot of burglars around lately.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:33.370
We're counting on you!

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:34.740
Okay.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.360
Hmm... what should I do now?

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.200
Hello!

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.370
Door to door shrimp salesman here!

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.220
Shrimp!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.410
I'll take a-

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:47.660
Hey!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.730
Eiko?!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.560
You can't just open the door for anyone!

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:54.060
But tricking me was just plain mean!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.430
I knew there was no way we could 
trust her to watch the house.

00:02:57.430 --> 00:02:59.280
She's likely to be easily tricked

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.110
by any shady salesman.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.160
Yeah, huh...

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:03.980
I won't get tricked!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:06.120
I'll keep the door shut tighter than a clam!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.270
Really?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.720
Then I want you to make a promise.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.330
Promise that you won't just 
blindly open the door

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.670
and let anyone in.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.360
Chizuru is gone and Eiko is gone.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.560
That means that, as of now, 
this house is Squid Territory!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.750
<i>We're aliens...</i>

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:34.860
<i>Who's an alien?!</i>

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:36.970
What an idiot!

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:38.780
Did you squidding see that?

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.910
I guess I'm the idiot for talking to myself.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:50.590
Food doesn't taste that inkredible 
when you eat it alone.

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:54.750
Wait a sec...

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:01.210
If Eiko's not here, I can play 
all the video games I want!

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.820
I'm tired of being alone.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.200
Oww, oww, oww...

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:20.260
Looks like I fell asleep.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.450
Looks like nobody's home.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.090
Who's there?

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.060
You!

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:32.760
Oh no!

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:35.880
Wait, you're Chizuru's father, aren't you?

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.320
Otherwise, there's no squidding way

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.010
you would dare to enter her house in your 
street shoes while she's not home!

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:45.290
I was able to get in because 
the door wasn't locked.

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:46.280
Whatever.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:49.010
Let's see if I can play along and get away.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.850
Looks like you got me!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.770
I'm Chizuru's dad!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.550
I knew it!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:55.980
I'll go call her right away!

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.400
Wait, hang on.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:01.470
I just sort of... stopped by, 
so I'll be going home now.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:02.470
Going home?

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:04.340
What are you talking about?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.820
You're her father, you live here.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.530
That's true!

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.320
Just relax.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:13.120
Like I could!

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:14.450
Damn it!

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.490
How the hell am I going to get out of here?

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.990
Want to play until Chizuru gets home?

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.200
Yup, this game is a lot

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:27.290
more fun when you play 
it with a squidpanion.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.430
What the hell am I doing here?

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.080
W-what?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.180
You don't look like Chizuru at all.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.190
Are you really her father?

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.270
Now you ask?!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.150
You don't even remember 
your own father's face.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.130
What an ungrateful child!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.510
You seem to be confused.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:51.080
I'm not actually a part of this family.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:51.800
Huh?

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.240
Then who are...

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:57.250
I'm here to squidvade this house!

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:59.210
You mean you're in the same business as me?!

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.590
I see.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.490
At first she thought

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.560
I was the father and tried to run away,

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:07.180
saying that she'd get the family.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:10.590
But when she noticed that I'm not 
the father, she was relieved,

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.890
so she revealed that we're 
in the same business.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:17.890
My goals and yours are the same!

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:21.780
You also crave world domination?

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.590
World domination?

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:27.980
That's quite the heady goal 
for someone so young.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.980
What kinds of places do you normally hit?

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:32.280
Well, there's the House by the Sea...

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:35.660
It's true, those are light on security.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:39.000
Then a karaoke place, a bowling alley,

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.880
a public pool, a family restaurant, 
and a department store.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.800
The most recent place I squidvaded 
was a police booth.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.760
Th-he police booth! 
This girl's really bold!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.090
But there was nobody there.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.300
She's so bold that she 
didn't seem suspicious!

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:56.770
How do you just go from 
one place to the next?

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:59.390
I did it all with my Invasion Club.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.320
So she runs an organization!

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.110
She's not fooling around!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.530
Please let me join this organization.

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.720
All right,

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.710
but I have to confer with the others first.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.240
Oh no!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.910
Has someone come home?!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:17.040
If this is a door to door shrimp 
salesman, we don't want any.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.960
I'm passing around a circular for...

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.910
You're going to have to come back 
some other squidding time!

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:23.620
You told her good.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:26.620
I guess this is what happens 
when you're really experienced.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.480
Well, they told me not to just 
blindly open the door

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.920
when I'm watching the house.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.800
You're here... to watch the house?

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:34.100
That's right.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:39.230
That could have been brought 
to my attention earlier!!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:44.150
Girlie, will you please go and 
tell Chizuru to come home?

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.560
I knew it! You want to see 
her as soon as squidable!

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.260
No problem!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.110
Now's my chance!

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:53.660
Chizuru!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.240
What are you doing here, Squid Girl?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.500
You're supposed to be watching the house!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.030
But Chizuru's father has come!

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:05.010
He's an invader, just like me.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:08.010
What do you mean, he's an invader?

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:11.300
Did he really say he was my father?

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:15.550
He came into the house 
while I was taking a squiddle nap...

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.350
You idiot!

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.290
That's not an invader, that's a burglar!

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.680
What's going on here?

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:26.930
He's a burglar.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:28.020
Sanae?

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:33.000
I saw the burglar on the 
surveillance camera I'd set up.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.450
That's why I alerted the police.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:37.390
So the surveillance camera...

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:38.580
You mean...

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:44.250
You really have to make 
sure to lock your doors!

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.860
Lemon

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.880
Thank you!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.050
It was delicious!

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.390
Come again!

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:51.090
Huh?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.970
It's a... shrimp!

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:58.900
Why the squid would someone leave 
a shrimp in a place like this?

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.850
It's still fresh!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.970
Over there, too!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.930
Where's Squid Girl?

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.770
I'll go look for her.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.710
Man, where'd she go to slack off this time?

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:21.290
Hmm?

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.160
What are these plates doing here?

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.200
Eiko...

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.920
I've basically pieced 
together what happened...

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:38.910
<b>Quitting Cold Squid?!</b>

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.190
Excellent!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:44.270
Our trap for aliens worked!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.180
So you guys are behind this?

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:49.610
We would never have thought 
a trap like this would work.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:53.030
You can start getting angry any time now.

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.530
I just want to crawl into a shell and hide.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.280
I guess her self-loathing is stronger.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.330
Now we can experiment on her 
to our heart's content!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.330
Hang on. I'm going to call my sister.

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:10.460
No... no... no!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:13.890
Just hang on.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:15.130
I'm going to open the door.

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:19.090
I'm really sorry.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.890
Geez, you're really a lot of trouble.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.890
I can't argue with that.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:28.180
It's my fault, for being so squidding
 weak when it comes to shrimp.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:30.310
I'm through feeling so ashamed!

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.020
Squid it! Today's the day 
I cut myself off from shrimp!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.360
You could say shrimp is 
your biggest enemy.

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:36.820
You're cutting yourself off from shrimp?

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.360
You got it!

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.570
I'm not going to be tempted 
by shrimp anymore!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.910
Is that so?

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:45.240
Tonight, we're having your 
favorite fried shrimp.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.400
Resist it, Squid Girlie!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.230
Resist...

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:50.330
Resist...

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.060
I can't resist it!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:56.050
That's about what one would expect.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.510
Is it good?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.010
It's squidelicious!

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:02.640
Even though it's poisoned?

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:07.270
I guess it'll start working 
in about two or three minutes.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.120
Goodbye, Squid Girl.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.760
I don't want to die yet!

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:15.660
Just kidding. I lied.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.460
Don't worry. It's not poisoned.

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:22.110
Coming fom her, it doesn't sound like a joke.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.380
However, the next one will be 
if you dare to touch

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.200
a customer's shrimp pilaf.

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:32.880
You mean I'll die if I can't resist shrimp.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.920
She means don't touch the customers' shrimp!

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:45.870
Please don't feed the Squid Girl shrimp

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.340
That sign is so tacky. 
It looks like a sign for a dog!

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:44.350
I guess I didn't have enough breakfast...

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:45.890
Squiddie!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.420
Sanae!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.670
You know, life is so much 
more fun if you just

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:52.350
let yourself give in to your desires!

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:54.360
You're an example of 
 giving in too much!

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.210
Come on!

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.730
Feel free to eat me!

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:03.320
I'm not desperate enough 
to eat chum like you!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.790
It's so tentalizing.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:12.750
I must resist.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:18.250
<i>Our Shrimp Festival is going on today!</i>

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.010
A Shrimp Festival?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.110
Shrimp Festival

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:28.080
Shrimp Festival - Frozen Products

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:34.880
Shrimp Festival
Shrimp Crackers

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:38.820
Miss!

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:43.990
Samples

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.550
Would you like to try one?

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:41.820
Thank you.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.990
It's a shrimp dumpling!

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:51.450
Why the squid are they
 doing this today of all days?

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.410
Huh? Shrimp Chili?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:54.550
Yeah.

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:59.580
My mom said she'd make it 
since you love shrimp so much.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:00.670
You're invited for dinner!

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.920
Kiyomi is inviting me to her house.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:07.040
I wish I had met your earlier.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:09.760
Squid Girlie?

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.900
It doesn't shrimpy taste like anything...

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.770
She's starting to talk funny.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:21.440
<i>Here is today's treasure,
 a succulent Spiny Lobster for 380 yen.</i>

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:23.940
It doesn't shrimpy taste like anything.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.410
Hey!

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:31.010
Shrimp Gratin
Out of stock

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.040
They're squidding out!

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.290
Here too!

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.270
<b>Out of shrimp</b>

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.920
I guess it's my squidestiny to not eat shrimp.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.050
Shrimp...

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.140
You idiot, what are you doing?

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.600
Shrimp!

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:59.310
Orca?!

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.980
Shrimp...

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:06.250
Shrimp...

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.850
Shrimp, shrimp, shrimp, shrimp, shrimp...

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:22.380
I don't even want to look 
at a shrimp anymore.

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:24.740
You don't have to torture yourself any more.

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:27.010
Squid Girlie, eat as much as you want.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:32.320
Why would I want to eat something 
as grotesque as that?

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:33.680
Squid Girlie?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.820
Then we'll eat that and you have this...

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.060
Potstickers?

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.120
Sis, what did you do?

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.660
They're shrimp potstickers...

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:55.460
I knew she wouldn't eat them otherwise.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.370
These taste awful.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.210
I squidding hate shrimp.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:03.010
Awful, awful.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.140
Geez, just eat them normally.

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:13.180
Where the squid am I?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:20.770
You regained consciousness 
a lot faster than I expected.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:21.970
Don't worry.

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:23.850
You're at the beach's first aid booth.

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:24.860
The first aid booth?

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:28.690
Yuigahama Lifeguard Pavilion

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:28.690
<b>First Aid Booth</b>

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:28.690
It's where we give first aid to people 
who hurt themselves at the beach.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.950
I got hurt?

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:34.780
You collapsed on the beach, 
so they brought you here.

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:38.120
I collapsed?

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.540
You must not have drunk enough water.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:45.020
We were so busy all day that 
I couldn't even take a squiddle break.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.710
Which is why you got dehydrated.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.940
Why don't you sleep until you feel better?

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.550
Thank you, I ink I will.

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:57.540
<b>Come Down With A Squiddle Heat Stroke?!</b>

00:15:57.820 --> 00:16:00.890
Excuse me. Do you have a free bed?

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:01.850
I do.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.570
Carry her over there.

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:04.400
Yes.

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.760
Hey, isn't that the Squid?

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:09.250
Did you get heat stroke, too?

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:10.990
Yeah...

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.570
S-Sanae!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.180
Hey... are you all right?

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.200
No... not at all.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.180
Nurse, please take care of her.

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:20.940
I will.

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:23.770
G-Goro...

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.130
You can't leave something this 
dangerous just floating around-

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.330
I'm sorry, Squiddie.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.070
For what?

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:38.360
You suddenly collapsed, 
so I tried to rush over to you, but...

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.890
Do you know why I collapsed?

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.350
She's got heat cramps.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.360
What did she mean,

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.800
she rushed over when I collapsed?

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:54.930
Was she trying to take squidvantage 
of me being unconscious?!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.950
If I stay here, I'll be attacked!

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:03.000
I can't get up.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:03.830
What are you doing?!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.850
You have to rest.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:07.070
Nurse?

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:08.590
Coming!

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:11.850
Are you leaving?

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:15.080
You'll be able to move in 
another 30 minutes or so.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.360
Until then, I want you to stay put.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:20.430
Please don't squidding leave me alone with her.

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:23.170
This is the worst case scenario!

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:25.600
If Sanae were to recover right now...

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:27.570
Squiddie!

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:31.110
I wouldn't be able to fend off her attacks!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:34.240
That's it, I've got to...

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:38.380
Doesn't look like she'll be 
on her tentacles anytime soon.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:41.370
It's two thirty.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.510
Thirty minutes is no time at all.

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.750
It will pass quickly.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:59.430
I wonder if the thirty minutes 
have already passed.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.220
Only one minute has squidding passed!

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.250
She's getting up!

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.920
I'm whale bait!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:17.050
Oh, I guess she just moved 
a bit in her sleep.

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:19.440
But wait...

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.370
if she's moving around,

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.200
it means she's going to be up soon!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.930
If that happens,

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:30.230
<b>Please stand by</b>

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.560
I can't even picture what comes next!

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:32.710
I'd rather be krilled!

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:41.120
Actually, I don't want to die yet!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:44.060
Please, God!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.850
I'll make good on all the 
bad things I did until now

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.430
if you'll protect this squid!

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.460
Hey, are you all right?

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:54.690
Eiko!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:56.470
Goro told me.

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:58.510
You hadn't come back from shopping,

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:02.010
so I thought surely you were just 
wasting time somewhere.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.680
Here's the water of life.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:07.100
There's something more crucial 
to my life than water right now!

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:10.130
If I don't get out of here, 
Sanae is going to krill me!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:12.320
She's in worse shape than you are.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.820
Are you all right? Hey, Sanae?

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.800
She's acting!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.260
Just before, she was up!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.980
You were imagining it.

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:25.770
Even Sanae wouldn't assault 
you in this situation.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:27.300
See you later.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.270
Please don't leave me.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.420
I really need to get back to our shop.

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:32.760
Sorry.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:39.350
She's going to attack me for sure 
as soon as Eiko's out of sight.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.700
I've got to find a weapon.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:47.540
With this, it doesn't matter 
where she comes from!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.500
Eiko's right.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.960
She really does look like she's 
in worse shape than I am.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.070
Squiddie...

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:20.110
I can't believe I fell asleep.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:25.310
I wonder what happened after Sanae got up?

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:27.890
Or is this already Squid Heaven?

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:30.870
Ow, I'm still alive.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.970
I should squidaddle while I still can.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.830
Nurse, I'm already a lot bet-

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.030
Oh, good!

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:42.050
You've woken up!

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:48.190
I just bought this water,
 so it's still cold.

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:52.590
Thank you.

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:55.990
I felt a lot better after 
I drank that water you gave me.

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:58.020
What the squid are you talking about?

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:02.190
You gave me a bottle of water.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.640
It made me so happy!

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.110
I'll cherish this for all my life!

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:11.830
The water bottle squidrificed itself for me!

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:13.270
To show my gratitude,

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:15.670
I'm going to nurse you 
back to health next time!

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:17.510
No, I don't want you to!

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.440
That would just be an excuse 
for you to squidssault me!

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.600
Come on!

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:23.850
It's not fair to lay a hand on 
someone who can't fight back.

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:25.130
You really think that?

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.550
Of course!

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:41.350
You look a lot better now.

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:43.560
How are we doing here?

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:45.300
I'm totally fine.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:48.320
I think you'll be back to normal soon, too.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:50.900
That's so great, Squiddie!

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:53.720
I'm happy that I'll be better soon,

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.610
but what are you going to 
do to me once I get better?

00:21:58.690 --> 00:21:59.990
Well, that's a...

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:05.870
Just get well soon!

00:22:06.770 --> 00:22:09.850
Maybe I won't get better 
for the rest of my squid life!

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:42.690
Oh, it's Ayumi Tokita.

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:44.320
Um, we're going to show

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:45.790
Eel you play house with me?!

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:47.040
Didn't we have a squidrrangement?!

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:48.770
Shall we jet over to an amusement park?!

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:49.720
next time.

00:23:49.720 --> 00:23:53.680
Um, I'm sorry. My father's 
always causing so much trouble.
